{"blocks": [{"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobSZybcR.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「撮られてる〜、どうしよう〜、」\nって思いながらニコニコが止まらない様子の私です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "おさがりの洋服を着てとうもろこしのパンケーキを食べに行きました。🎀☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とうもろこしを見かける機会が増えて夏を感じています。🌽\nかき氷にもとうもろこし味があるんだよ〜。😳"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを開いていただき、\nありがとうございます！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "埼玉県出身のえんどうりこです。☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobuxMg0A.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mob0Yq6w5.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どっちもおんなじポーズだった。笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お団子は触りたくなるよね、、、？🍡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobsiNiOT.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "れいなちゃんの手。📸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "このブログを書いているときに、\nちょうどれいなちゃんから昔の私の写真が送られてきました。笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "3.4年前、泣き終わったばかりの目が赤い写真です、、、、。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今思うとそんなことで泣いてたのかとびっくりしますが、\nれいなちゃんには大人になった証拠だねと言ってもらえました。笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobqwCLIo.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "わ〜。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "少し前、凪ちゃんに丸襟似合いそうっていってもらえたことがあって、\nだから今回は丸襟っぽいお洋服を探して着てみたよー！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mob94RHJr.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ハーフツインしたよ。☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なぜかハーフツインをするときは勇気がいるのですが、みんなに褒めてもらえたのでひと安心。😌"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ツアーはどんな髪型にしよう。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんな何が好きー？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobo8HLJ3.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobOkM49T.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "りかちゃんに動物みたいなポーズしてっていってもらってこの笑顔☺︎🦁"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たしかに髪型がふさふさしてて\n動物感あるね。笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobz7OlQ2.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そしてそしてこの日は\nひいろちゃんとのペアレーンでした！☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ひいろちゃんファンの皆さんも\nありがとうございます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "埼玉出身だよー、3人でおなじだねー。\nなどなど言ってくれる方もいっぱいいらっしゃって、地元トークができて楽しかった〜🫶"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "少し写真がボケてしまっていたので、\nツアーでツーショットのリベンジをしようと思います🫡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "気づいたら\nツアーまで後1週間！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Buddiesの皆さんは\n夏バテとか大丈夫ですか、？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなで万全な状態で\nツアーを楽しめるように、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たくさん食べて、休める時もたくさん！\nカラダを休めてください〜🫶"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "毎日暑い中お疲れ様です、！☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://store.plusmember.jp/sakurazaka46/"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "グッズも解禁されているので、\nぜひみてね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでいただき、\nありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日のブログはここまで〜。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobUaZSJO.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "夏の夜は花火をしたくなるね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "できるといいな〜、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね！"}], "source": "official"}